And if your love is true,

828
01:27:07,664 --> 01:27:13,036
Everything will be just as wonderful

829
01:27:20,463 --> 01:27:24,316
Now, I belong to you

830
01:27:24,642 --> 01:27:29,730
From this day until forever,

831
01:27:29,848 --> 01:27:33,335
Just love me tenderly

832
01:27:33,460 --> 01:27:38,161
And I'll give to you every part of me

833
01:27:38,315 --> 01:27:43,478
Oh oh, don’t ever make me cry

834
01:27:43,617 --> 01:27:48,891
Through long lonely nights without love

835
01:27:48,963 --> 01:27:52,358
Be always true to me,

836
01:27:52,445 --> 01:27:57,687
Keep this day in your heart eternally

837
01:27:58,265 --> 01:28:02,221
You hold me in your arms,

838
01:28:02,561 --> 01:28:07,501
And say once again you love me,

839
01:28:07,867 --> 01:28:11,269
And if your love is true,

840
01:28:11,440 --> 01:28:16,829
Everything will be just as wonderful

841
01:28:30,325 --> 01:28:31,788
